    "user": "U08EXEBDXQD",
    "text": "1. So, to clarify: bpf_copy_from_buffer copies at most \"size\" bytes of the WHOLE file to ptr+offset?\n2. Should bpf_lzo_compress then also compress the whole file?\n3. If so, is there any usage of the size and offset fields of the compress_ctx? Because right now it seems like no?",
